./paper-sources/lehalleur-rimanyi-2024-geometry-of-dln-fibre/source/main.bbl:49:M.~Aoyagi.
./paper-sources/lehalleur-rimanyi-2024-geometry-of-dln-fibre/source/main.bbl:151:S.~P. Lehalleur.
